@startuml
title xiaobucubic 数据流示例
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

cloud "订阅平台与天气数据源" as sources
component "用量与天气采集器" as collectors
component "Python 显示服务" as server
database "JSON 状态文件" as storage
component "HoloCubic 客户端\nLua + LVGL" as client

sources --> collectors : 查询用量与天气
collectors --> server : HTTP PUT\n写入 token
server --> storage : 持久化数据
storage --> server : 启动时恢复
client --> server : GET /v1/display\n读取 token（如已配置）
server --> client : schema v1 JSON

note bottom of client
  显示额度、天气与提醒
  保留有效缓存，失败后退避重试
end note

@enduml
